Subject: Cantor M2B Supplied Ordered Topology Inventory Digest Source

Description: Raw selected build source for one zero-effect, versioned, architecture-independent canonical encoding and SHA-256 commitment over the ordered TopologyEntryObservation sequence retained by a completed supplied topology inventory assembly. It confers no physical enumeration, completeness, temporal, double-inventory, receipt, or admission authority.

